<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE topic PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Topic//EN" "topic.dtd">
<topic id="git-addon-git-branch-manager">
  <title>Git Branch Manager View</title>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>Git Branch Manager</indexterm></indexterm>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>branches</indexterm></indexterm>
      </keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <body>
    <p id="p_elv_4qy_kpb">The <uicontrol>Git Branch Manager</uicontrol> view shows the local and
      remote branches for the current repository.</p>
    <section id="section_git_branch_manager_how_to_open"><title>Open Git Branch Manager</title><p>To
        open the <uicontrol>Git Branch Manager</uicontrol> view, use one of the following:</p><ul
        id="ul_git_branch_manager_view_access">
        <li id="li_git_branch_manager_view_access_staging">Select <uicontrol><image
              href="../img/Branch18.png" id="image_branch_icon"/>Show Git Branch Manager
            view</uicontrol> from the <uicontrol>Git Staging</uicontrol> toolbar.</li>
        <li id="li_git_branch_manager_view_access_window">Go to <menucascade>
            <uicontrol>Window</uicontrol>
            <uicontrol>Show View</uicontrol>
            <uicontrol>Git Branch Manager</uicontrol>
          </menucascade>.</li>
        <li>Select <xref
            href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_show_branches"
              ><uicontrol>Show Branches</uicontrol></xref> from the <xref
            href="git-addon-git-menu.dita#git-addon-git-menu"><uicontrol>Git</uicontrol>
          menu</xref>.</li>
      </ul></section>
    <p><fig id="fig_git_branch_manager_view">
        <title>Git Branch Manager view</title>
        <image href="img/branches/branch_manager_view.png" id="image_qzw_5sk_gjc"
          placement="inline"/>
      </fig></p>
    <section id="section_git_branch_manager_filter"><title>Text Filter and Refresh</title><p>Use
          <uicontrol>Text filter</uicontrol> to narrow the branch tree by name. Select
            <uicontrol><image href="../img/Refresh16.png" placement="inline" id="image_fm3_25k_gjc"
          />Refresh</uicontrol> to reload branch information. Opening the view or selecting
          <uicontrol>Refresh</uicontrol> also fetches updates in the background so remote branches
        and tracking information stay current.</p></section>
    <section id="section_git_branch_manager_branch_tree"><title>Branch Tree</title><p
        id="p_flv_4qy_kpb">The branch tree groups branches into <uicontrol>Local</uicontrol> and
          <uicontrol>Remote</uicontrol> nodes. Hover over a branch name to see a tooltip with
        information about the last commit, including author and date.</p><p
        id="p_git_branch_manager_remote_branch_intro">For remote branches, use <xref
          href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_checkout"
            ><uicontrol>Checkout</uicontrol></xref> to create a local branch from the selected
        remote branch.</p><p id="p_git_branch_manager_fetch_actions">Right-click
          <uicontrol>Remote</uicontrol> to fetch all configured remotes, or right-click an
        individual remote such as <uicontrol>origin</uicontrol> to fetch only that remote.</p>
    </section>
    <section id="section_git_branch_manager_local_branch_actions"><title>Local Branch
        Actions</title><p>Right-click a local or remote branch to access shared actions. Shared
        actions available in the branch context menu — including <xref
          href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_checkout"
            ><uicontrol>Checkout</uicontrol></xref>, <xref
          href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_create_branch"
            ><uicontrol>Create Branch</uicontrol></xref>, <xref
          href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_merge_branch_or_commit"
            ><uicontrol>Merge</uicontrol></xref>, <xref
          href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_track_remote_branch"
            ><uicontrol>Track Remote Branch</uicontrol></xref>, <xref
          href="git-addon-actions-synchronize-conflicts.dita#git-addon-actions-synchronize-conflicts/action_push"
            ><uicontrol>Push</uicontrol></xref>, and <xref
          href="git-addon-actions-synchronize-conflicts.dita#git-addon-actions-synchronize-conflicts/action_pull_merge"
            ><uicontrol>Pull</uicontrol></xref> — are described in the <xref
          href="git-addon-actions-reference.dita#git-addon-actions-reference">Git Actions Reference</xref>.</p><p id="p_glv_4qy_kpb">Right-click a local branch to access the following
          actions:</p><p><table frame="all" rowsep="1" colsep="1"
          id="table_git_branch_manager_local_branch_actions">
          <title>Git Branch Manager local branch context menu actions</title>
          <tgroup cols="2">
            <colspec colname="c1" colwidth="2*"/>
            <colspec colname="c2" colwidth="5*"/>
            <thead>
              <row>
                <entry>Action</entry>
                <entry>Description</entry>
              </row>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <row>
                <entry><xref
                    href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_squash_merge_branch"
                      ><uicontrol>Squash Merge</uicontrol></xref></entry>
                <entry>Merges changes from the selected branch since it diverged from the current
                  branch and records the result as a single new commit.</entry>
              </row>
              <row>
                <entry><xref
                    href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_show_in_history"
                      ><uicontrol>Show in History</uicontrol></xref></entry>
                <entry>Selects the <codeph>HEAD</codeph> commit of the selected branch in the
                    <uicontrol>Git History</uicontrol> view.</entry>
              </row>
              <row>
                <entry><xref
                    href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_delete_branch"
                      ><uicontrol>Delete Branch</uicontrol></xref></entry>
                <entry>Deletes the selected local branch. Make sure the branch work was merged,
                  pushed, or is no longer needed before deleting.</entry>
              </row>
            </tbody>
          </tgroup>
        </table></p><p><fig id="fig_git_branch_manager_branch_context_menu">
          <title>Git Branch Manager Local Branch Contextual Menu</title>
          <image href="img/branches/local_branch_context_menu.png" placement="inline"
            id="image_git_branch_manager_branch_context_menu"/>
        </fig>
      </p></section>
  </body>
</topic>